        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1100EDSVTBAR Grade 2 Surface Vertical Rod Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>Surface Vertical Rod panic device is the perfect choice for double doors without mullions. Suitable for all doors (aluminum, hollow metal, or wood), durable enough for the most demanding applications.</p>\r\n<p>Theses vertical rod exit devices are <b>non-handed, reversible for right or left hand doors 30\" - 36\" wide</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications: </b><ul>\r\n<li>Material: Extruded anodized aluminum push bar</li>\r\n<li>Latch: Top pullman type, Bottom bolt assembly</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" on 4-1/2\" minimum stile width - if less than 4-1/2\" backset becomes half of the exposed stile width</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Top - surface mounted, Bottom - flat mortise or into threshold</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\" - 1-7/8\" dogged </li>\r\n<li>Stile: 4-1/2\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: 7' standard. Add <a href=\"/products/1-foot-surface-mount-vertical-rod-extension-glo-th1100-extrod\"><b>1 Foot Extension</b></a> for 8' doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" standard</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: 36\", can be field sized to 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 41\" from finished floor to center line of push rail. </li>\r\n<li>Fastners: Furnished with sheet metal and machine screws</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: 1/2\" turn hex key</li>\r\n<li>Fire Rating: Available Option</li>\r\n<li>Grade 2</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 1 Year</li></ul></p>\r\n<p><b>Available Exterior Trim:</b><ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/pull-trim-with-rim-cylinder-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pled-rc\">Pull Plate with Rim Lock Cylinder</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/pull-plate-trim-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pldum-al\">Pull Plate</a>: Dummy Function - Used as a door pull only.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/exit-only-block-off-plate-for-exit-device-global-th1100-pleo-al\">Exit Only Plate</a>: Blank block off plate covers pre drilled holes.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/entry-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhed\">Keyed Classroom Lever</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key.  ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/storeroom-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhst\">Keyed Storeroom Lever</a>: Storeroom Function (ANSI F09) - Outside entrance by lever only when released by key (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked. ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/passage-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhps\">Passage Lever</a>: Passage  Function (ANSI F14) - Outside entrance by lever for doors that don't need locking. ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/entry-knob-for-panic-device-global-th1100-baled\">Keyed Classroom Ball Knob</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-rim-exit-device\">Escutcheon Plate Keyed Classroom Lever</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key. Escutcheon Plate (2-1/2\" wide x 8-7/8\" high) with ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/exterior-handleset-for-panic-device-global-th1100-dumed-al\">Dummy Handleset</a>: Dummy Function - Used as a door pull only.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/night-latch-handleset-for-panic-device-global-th1100-nled-al\">Night Latch Handleset</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/thumb-lift-handleset-for-panic-device-global-th1100-tped-al\">Thumb Lift Classroom Handleset</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Thumb Lift locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "30 to 36-inch Grade 2 Surface Vertical Rod Door Panic Device  TH1100EDSVTBAR",
                "description": "The Global Surface Vertical Rod panic device is the perfect choice for double doors without mullions.  complete selection of exterior trim fuctions are avaialble for these touch bar exit devices including keyed entry, passage, night latch, levers, knobs and handlesets.",
